    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Away from the traffic and noise, a pale-yellow "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cottage",
            "zh": "村舍"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " behind a tall "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "yew tree",
            "zh": "紫杉树"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " catches the eye. It looks like something straight out of "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Snow White"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "High up near the top of a ladder, on the cottage’s roof, stands Dominic Meek. He’s busy removing the old "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "thatch",
            "zh": "茅草屋顶"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Bit by bit, the “base coat”, a layer of straw that may be over 200 years old, comes into view. At the same time, a tower of new wheat straw waits on a nearby "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trailer",
            "zh": "拖车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Rolls",
            "ref": "v-roll"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of netting lie ready in the garden. Once the new thatch is in place, Meek will fix the netting tightly across the roof to protect it from birds and bugs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Meek is a thatcher based in a beautiful corner of Suffolk in eastern England. He started thatching 31 years ago, at the age of 23. In 2001, he started his own thatching business."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Over the centuries, little has changed about this traditional "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "craft",
            "ref": "v-craft"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Metal netting is a rare modern "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "addition",
            "ref": "v-addition"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “Maybe the only change is how we move the materials,” says Meek. “Now, we can carry straw in a trailer, so we can work farther from home. In the old days, every area had its own thatcher. Even with horses, you couldn’t take the straw very far.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Clearly, there’s more to thatch than its storybook looks. “It’s the greenest roof covering you can get. Its "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "carbon footprint",
            "zh": "碳足迹"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is very low,” Meek explains. “It keeps you warm in the cold and cool in the heat. And if you take good care of it, it can last for many, many years.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some consider thatching a dying art, but Meek doesn’t buy that. In Suffolk alone, there are over 3,500 thatched houses. Each one needs repairs every 10 to 15 years. Meek hopes that more young people will learn the craft and join his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "trade",
            "ref": "v-trade"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
